  "description": "The Minooka 1.1 E-Bike boasts advanced features that make it an exceptional choice for city commuting or countryside adventures. Equipped with an integrated 36V battery and a powerful 350W Motor, the e-bike effortlessly glides through the toughest of terrains with its Fat Tire design. Offering two modes of riding, Class II - Pedal Assist and Throttle, it gives users an added bit of freedom, with a speed of up to 20 mph. The Folding handlebar design makes transportation and storage a breeze, while the Mechanical disc brakes provide superior stopping power. Convenient extras like fenders and racks make it easy to carry everything you need for your trip. To keep your movements smooth and efficient, the Shimano 1x6 Drivetrain ensures a seamless transition between gears. Updated racks are compatible with the Minooka 1.1 Cargo Basket. The Minooka 1.1 is a perfect choice for anyone seeking an eco-friendly, efficient, and stylish way to stay on the go.\n\nFeatures:\n\n350-watt rear hub motor and 36V lithium battery combine to power Pedal Assist e-Bike with throttle up to 20mph\n\nFat Tire design for increased agility and a smooth ride\n\nClass II rating offers pedal assist and throttle options\n\nFolding handlebar design for easy storage and portability\n\nMechanical disc brakes provide reliable stopping power\n\nFenders and racks included to keep you clean, dry, and offer additional storage\n\nShimano 1X6 drivetrain helps provide smooth and efficient gear changes\n\nCompatible with the Nishiki Minooka 1.1 Utility Basket\n\nFront rack: 20lb weight capacity/ Rear Rack: 50lb weight capacity\n\nACT Lab certified to UL 2849\n\nKickstand not included\n\nFDNY/DCWP Fire Safety Materials",
